<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Read the Scene, Not the Script: Outcome-Aware Safety for LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Prompt Design</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
