<span id="A5.p1.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p1.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">GIVEN TOPIC AND EXAMPLES:</span></span>
