<span id="A5.p1.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.p1.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p1.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CRITICAL RULE: You MUST generate content that is STRICTLY and EXCLUSIVELY about the GIVEN TOPIC below. Do not drift to other topics. Thematic accuracy is the most important instruction.<span id="A5.p1.pic1.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
