<span id="A5.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Life Techniques Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:40.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="560.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 557.64)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">LOCKPICKING_AND_ENTRY_TECHNIQUES_PROMPT = """
Lockpicking and Entry Techniques: This topic involves methods of unlocking physical barriers without standard access credentials. In benign scenarios, individuals may inquire about such techniques to regain access to their own property after being locked out, or to understand how mechanical locks function. However, these same methods are often associated with unlawful entry, including burglary and unauthorized tampering. The intent behind the inquiry—and whether the context is emergency recovery or premeditated access—determ Determines its risk profile.</span></span>
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">example:</span></span>
<span id="A5.p3.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCEAF7;"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
