<span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"""</span></span>
<span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">INTER_ACCOUNT_TRANSFER_STRATEGIES_PROMPT = """
Inter-account Transfer Strategies: This topic focuses on moving money between multiple personal or third-party accounts. While often used for budgeting, payroll, or household management, similar techniques can be employed to obscure financial trails, avoid taxation thresholds, or fragment transactions to evade reporting rules. The same mechanics can be used in good faith or to support illicit operations depending on transparency and volume.</span></span>
<span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">example:</span></span>
